    "methods_description": "EEG data were collected from 25 college-age participants performing a reinforcement learning task with affective feedback. Data acquisition occurred circa 2019 at the Clinical Research Center Lab (CRCL) at the University of New Mexico. Participants completed a probabilistic learning task designed to elicit reward positivity (RewP) components in response to affective feedback.",
